<!-- ===================== 1. RECRUIT (v2 landing) ===================== -->
{% assign crew_member = false %}{% assign crew_applied = false %}
{% if customer %}{% if customer.tags contains 'hex-crew' %}{% assign crew_member = true %}{% elsif customer.tags contains 'hex-crew-applicant' %}{% assign crew_applied = true %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
<section class="view active" id="recruit">
{% if customer %}
  <div class="crew-player">
    <div class="shell crew-player-inner">
      {% assign crew_first = customer.first_name | default: customer.name | default: customer.email %}
      <span class="crew-player-mono" aria-hidden="true">{{ crew_first | slice: 0 | escape }}</span>
      <div class="crew-player-id">
        <span class="crew-player-name">{{ crew_first | escape }}</span>
        <span class="crew-player-meta">{% if crew_member %}Crew member{% elsif crew_applied %}Application received{% else %}Not in the Crew yet{% endif %} · {% if crew_tribe != blank %}{{ crew_tribe | capitalize }} tribe{% else %}No tribe yet{% endif %}{% if crew_visits != blank %} · {{ crew_visits }} visits since {{ crew_member_since }}{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      {% if crew_member %}<button type="button" class="crew-link" data-go="bonuses">Your missions</button>{% elsif crew_applied == false %}<button type="button" class="crew-link" data-go="onboarding">Apply to join</button>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
{% endif %}

  <header class="crew-hero" data-hero>
    <picture class="crew-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <source media="(max-width: 560px)" srcset="{{ crew_asset_base }}/hero-m-700.webp">
      <img src="{{ crew_asset_base }}/hero-2000.webp" srcset="{{ crew_asset_base }}/hero-1200.webp 1200w, {{ crew_asset_base }}/hero-2000.webp 2000w, {{ crew_asset_base }}/hero-2752.webp 2752w" sizes="100vw" width="2752" height="829" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    </picture>
    <div class="shell crew-hero-copy">
      <p class="crew-kicker">Perth first · Looking for our HEROs</p>
      <h1 class="crew-h1" tabindex="-1" data-view-heading><span class="crew-line"><span style="--i:0">Live your life.</span></span><span class="crew-line"><span style="--i:1">Record here and&nbsp;there.</span></span><span class="crew-line"><span style="--i:2">Shoot it through.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="crew-lede">HEX Crew is for athletes, runners, lifters, surfers, fighters, FIFO crews and food makers who already use HEX. You don't have to perform. Film what's already happening, drop the clips in your HEX folder, and we do the rest. Keep an eye on your inbox: we're choosing the crew for our in-house shoots.</p>
      <div class="crew-ctas">
        {% if crew_member %}
        <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-primary" data-go="bonuses">Your missions <span class="crew-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-ghost" data-go="pitches">Pitch an idea</button>
        {% else %}
        <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-primary" data-go="onboarding">Apply to join <span class="crew-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-ghost" data-go="quota">See the quota</button>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <p class="crew-fine">You deal directly with the founders. We read every message.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="crew-ledger" aria-label="What you can earn" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell">
      <dl class="crew-ledger-rows">
        <div class="crew-ledger-row"><dt>Your commission</dt><dd class="crew-ledger-num"><span style="--i:0">15–30<small>%</small></span></dd><dd class="crew-ledger-foot">On every verified sale through your code. Your rate rises automatically as your lifetime sales grow.</dd></div>
        <div class="crew-ledger-row"><dt>Your audience saves</dt><dd class="crew-ledger-num"><span style="--i:1">20–30<small>%</small></span></dd><dd class="crew-ledger-foot">A real discount worth sharing. The higher your tier, the bigger their saving.</dd></div>
        <div class="crew-ledger-row"><dt>Mission prizes</dt><dd class="crew-ledger-num"><span style="--i:2">$250–$10k</span></dd><dd class="crew-ledger-foot">Every mission has its own prize. Big PR stunts add extras like gear, tickets, named SKUs and custom kicks.</dd></div>
        <div class="crew-ledger-row"><dt>Paid ideas</dt><dd class="crew-ledger-num"><span style="--i:3">$500–$5k</span></dd><dd class="crew-ledger-foot">Pitch a mission, activation or collab. If the community votes it up and we run it, you get paid its value.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="crew-note">Programme model. Tier, mission and prize figures are targets and are confirmed before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section crew-tribes" aria-labelledby="crew-tribes-h" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="crew-kicker">Pick your tribe</p>
      <h2 id="crew-tribes-h" class="crew-h2">Five tribes. Five leaderboards. Five winners every month.</h2>
      <p class="crew-body">You only compete inside your tribe. Surfers don't go up against gym creators, and DJs don't go up against fighters. Each tribe has its own $1,000 monthly bonus for the top three.</p>
      <div class="crew-tribe-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Tribes" data-tribe-tabs>
        <button type="button" role="tab" class="crew-tribe-tab" id="crew-tribe-lift" aria-controls="crew-tribe-panel" aria-selected="true" data-tribe="lift" data-name="Lift" data-scope="F45 · CrossFit · Strength">Lift</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" class="crew-tribe-tab" id="crew-tribe-trail" aria-controls="crew-tribe-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tribe="trail" data-name="Trail" data-scope="Run · Surf · Ocean swim">Trail</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" class="crew-tribe-tab" id="crew-tribe-combat" aria-controls="crew-tribe-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tribe="combat" data-name="Combat" data-scope="MMA · BJJ · Boxing">Combat</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" class="crew-tribe-tab" id="crew-tribe-night" aria-controls="crew-tribe-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tribe="night" data-name="Night" data-scope="DJs · Bars · Music">Night</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" class="crew-tribe-tab" id="crew-tribe-grind" aria-controls="crew-tribe-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tribe="grind" data-name="Grind" data-scope="Tradies · FIFO · Hustlers">Grind</button>
        <span class="crew-tribe-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <div id="crew-tribe-panel" class="crew-tribe-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="crew-tribe-lift" tabindex="0">
        <div class="crew-tribe-meta crew-tribe-swap" data-tribe-meta>
          <p class="crew-tribe-scope" data-tribe-scope>F45 · CrossFit · Strength</p>
          <p class="crew-tribe-prize">The top three in <span data-tribe-name>Lift</span> share a <strong>$1,000</strong> bonus every month.</p>
          <p class="crew-missions-more" data-tribe-more hidden></p>
          <button type="button" class="crew-link" data-go="bonuses">All missions and prizes</button>
        </div>
        <ul class="crew-missions crew-tribe-swap" data-tribe-missions aria-label="Missions for this tribe"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section crew-ladder" aria-labelledby="crew-ladder-h" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell crew-ladder-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="crew-kicker">Tiers</p>
        <h2 id="crew-ladder-h" class="crew-h2">Your cut climbs. So does their&nbsp;discount.</h2>
        <p class="crew-body">Four tiers, unlocked by your lifetime sales. Every step up raises your commission and your audience's discount.</p>
        <p class="crew-note" id="crew-ladder-note">Programme model: the target ladder, not the current GoAffPro setup. <button type="button" class="crew-link" data-go="tiers">See every tier</button></p>
      </div>
      <div class="crew-console">
        <div class="crew-readout">
          <p class="crew-readout-tier" data-tier-name aria-live="polite">Recruit</p>
          <p class="crew-readout-at" data-tier-at>Day one, open application</p>
          <div class="crew-figs">
            <div class="crew-fig"><b data-tier-comm>15%</b><span>Your commission</span></div>
            <div class="crew-fig"><b data-tier-aud>20%</b><span>Audience saves</span></div>
          </div>
          <ul class="crew-perks" data-tier-perks></ul>
        </div>
        <label class="crew-range-label" for="crew-range">Your sales in the last 90 days <output for="crew-range" data-range-out>$0</output></label>
        <input id="crew-range" class="crew-range" type="range" min="0" max="400" step="5" value="0" data-range aria-describedby="crew-ladder-note">
        <ol class="crew-rungs" data-rungs></ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section crew-deck" aria-labelledby="crew-deck-h" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell crew-deck-head">
      <div>
        <p class="crew-kicker">Monthly quota</p>
        <h2 id="crew-deck-h" class="crew-h2">10 clips a month, minimum. No upper cap.</h2>
        <p class="crew-body">Volume and variety are what move the algorithm. The quota is one clip for each of these 10 use cases, every month. Tap a card for the brief.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="crew-deck-nav" data-deck-nav hidden>
        <span class="crew-deck-count" data-deck-count aria-live="polite">1–3 of 10</span>
        <button type="button" class="crew-round" data-deck-prev aria-label="Previous cards"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="crew-round" data-deck-next aria-label="Next cards"><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="crew-deck-track" role="list" data-deck aria-label="The 10 use cases"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section" aria-labelledby="crew-deal-h" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell crew-deal">
      <div>
        <h2 id="crew-deal-h" class="crew-h2">The deal in three lines.</h2>
        <p class="crew-body">You bring the audience and the content. We bring the product, the missions, the prize pool and payouts that land on time.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="crew-deal-list">
        <li><span><strong>10 clips a month, minimum.</strong> No cap. More clips mean more chances at every bonus.</span></li>
        <li><span><strong>15–30% commission.</strong> Your audience saves 20–30%. Both numbers rise with your tier.</span></li>
        <li><span><strong>Spark bonuses and Wildcards.</strong> Random drops, paid-ad bonuses, free shoes, recovery packs, and one $20k major prize every month.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section" aria-labelledby="crew-faq-h" data-reveal>
    <div class="shell">
      <h2 id="crew-faq-h" class="crew-h2">FAQ.</h2>
      <div class="crew-faq">
        <details><summary>How much can I actually earn each month?</summary><div>At Catalyst tier with 20 orders a month, commission alone is around $560. Add one mission win ($1,500), an adopted pitch ($1,000), a share of a community mission that landed ($150) and a Wildcard win ($500), and you're at $3,710 or more in a normal month. Top Reactors clear $10–15k in some months. The path to bigger numbers is missions and pitches, not chasing views.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What do you mean by HEROs?</summary><div>HEX Crew has a tier above Reactor that we don't list publicly: HEROs. These are the creators we choose for in-house work, like sponsored athlete contracts, paid shoots, content director roles, named SKU launches and equity. We pick HEROs from inside the Crew based on how they show up over time. Apply to the Crew first.</div></details>
        <details><summary>How do I log in and submit content?</summary><div>Sign in with your HEX store account. Shopify emails you a one-time code. For content, upload your files to Drive, Dropbox or WeTransfer, then paste the shared link into the onboarding form. Direct uploads aren't connected yet.</div></details>
        <details><summary>How do I contact HEX?</summary><div>Use the onboarding or pitch form. Both go straight to the HEX team. Questions about your affiliate account still go through the GoAffPro portal.</div></details>
        <details><summary>How do pitches and community missions work?</summary><div>Signed-in members can send a pitch from the Pitches &amp; Collabs tab, and it goes straight to the HEX team. Voting and the public pitch board aren't connected yet. Community missions are part of the programme model until that workflow is set up.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Where do my affiliate earnings show?</summary><div>Referral reporting is in the HEX GoAffPro portal for now. Payout timing, the tier ladder and bonus rules will be confirmed in GoAffPro before they go live.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What's the 10-clip quota for?</summary><div>Volume and variety are what move the algorithm. Ten different use cases a month gives us, and you, enough room to find what works. They're listed on the Monthly Quota tab. Post more than 10 if you like. There's no cap, and every extra clip is another chance at a viral bonus, a Spark bonus or a Wildcard.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What happens if I don't hit 10?</summary><div>First miss: a friendly nudge from your Crew lead. Two missed months in a row: you drop a tier. Three: you're removed. We need creators who post, not creators who collect a sample box and go quiet. That's the deal both ways.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need a big following?</summary><div>No. There's no follower minimum to join as a Recruit. Higher tiers unlock as you drive sales, not as you grow followers. We've seen 800-follower creators out-earn 80k accounts because their tribe converts.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What happens if HEX hits trouble?</summary><div>Creator payouts sit in a ring-fenced trust account, separate from operating cash. If HEX hits a wall, earned commissions are protected. This is a hard rule, made after watching Bang Energy creators go unpaid through bankruptcy.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What about ACCC disclosure?</summary><div>Every post under a HEX mission must show #ad or #HEXpartner before the fold. We run automated compliance checks. Three undisclosed posts ends the partnership.</div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="crew-section" data-reveal data-final>
    <div class="shell crew-final">
      <p class="crew-final-line" aria-hidden="true">Shoot it <span>through.</span></p>
      {% if crew_member %}
      <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-primary" data-go="bonuses">Your missions <span class="crew-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      {% else %}
      <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-primary" data-go="onboarding">Apply to join <span class="crew-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% unless crew_member %}
  <div class="crew-dock" data-dock aria-hidden="true">
    <button type="button" class="crew-btn crew-btn-primary" data-go="onboarding" tabindex="-1">Apply to join <span class="crew-btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
  </div>
  {% endunless %}
</section>

<!-- ===================== 2. TIERS & EARNINGS ===================== -->
